# Design assets and decks. Kept locally, not in the repo: they are exports and
# slides rather than source, they change as whole binaries so every revision is
# stored in full, and frontend-improv alone was 31MB - a third of it duplicate
# .zip copies of folders sitting right next to them.
frontend-improv/
*.pptx
*.zip

# Working notes and loose knowledge-base copies, kept locally only.
# Paths are anchored to the repo root on purpose: backend/knowledge-bases/ and
# backend/sample-knowledge-base.csv are the copies the image and the tests
# actually use, and a bare *.csv rule would take those out too.
/APPLY.md
/MIGRATION.md
/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
/PROJECT_CONTEXT_UPDATE_2.md
/dsa-easy-knowledge-base.csv
/sde-backend-english.csv
/sde-backend-hindi.csv
/product-manager.json

# Silero VAD model and ONNX runtime, copied from node_modules by
# scripts/copy-vad-assets.mjs on predev/prebuild. Build inputs, not source.
frontend/public/vad/

# Local planning notes, deliberately not shared.
FUTURE_GOALS.md
